    <briefdescription>
<para>One category of a <computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1BarSeries" kindref="compound">BarSeries</ref></computeroutput> or <computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1RectangleSeries" kindref="compound">RectangleSeries</ref>:</computeroutput> a value, a name, and a fill color. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Data points carry the category <computeroutput>value</computeroutput> as their <computeroutput>category</computeroutput>. The <computeroutput>name</computeroutput> labels the category in the legend and in <computeroutput>barAt()</computeroutput> / <computeroutput>rectangleAt()</computeroutput>, and QML data can use it instead of the value.</para>
<para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">QAccelPlot.RectangleSeries<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>categories:<sp/>[</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>QAccelPlot.Category<sp/>{<sp/><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1Category_1a329a65e65b0664c36242deb554fb8074" kindref="member">value</ref>:<sp/>0;<sp/><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1Category_1aa56e800e6c107c219839466c90566d81" kindref="member">name</ref>:<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;Running&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">;<sp/><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1Category_1a69e1147a12652e9c347ea27378598ba9" kindref="member">color</ref>:<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;seagreen&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>},</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>QAccelPlot.Category<sp/>{<sp/><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1Category_1a329a65e65b0664c36242deb554fb8074" kindref="member">value</ref>:<sp/>1;<sp/><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1Category_1aa56e800e6c107c219839466c90566d81" kindref="member">name</ref>:<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;Alarm&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">;<sp/><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1Category_1a69e1147a12652e9c347ea27378598ba9" kindref="member">color</ref>:<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;firebrick&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1BarSeries_1ae728069dc8cceeea2cb9bb28e5c0cec8" kindref="member">BarSeries::categories</ref>, <ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1RectangleSeries_1ab5db60ed9c8b7777149175b6d897ea23" kindref="member">RectangleSeries::categories</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
